{"version":1,"content":"<p>視后李佳芯（Ali）、陳湛文及劉漪琳今日（24日）為主演舞台劇《見面即地獄》綵排，大會現場宣布《見》劇將於12月26日加開一場，另24、25日中午場後將特別加開主創分享會，陪觀眾一起過聖誕。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;首次挑</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:44:06.090638+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:09:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:37:13.630756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:37:13.630756+00:00","content_hash":"8205cd09c65ff690c155b8e1b637b502fee3693ecb9bc1a8791c4145aff33b99","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}